                    "#[[Image:Calculate Series and Parallel Resistance Step 2.jpg|right|300px]]What it is. Parallel resistance is when the \"in\" side of 2 or more resistors are connected, and the \"out\" side of those resistors are connected.",
                    "#[[Image:Calculate Series and Parallel Resistance Step 3 Version 2.jpg|right|300px]]What it is. A combined network is any combination of series and parallel circuits wired together. Consider finding the equivalent resistance of the network shown below.<br><br>"
