                    "#*[[Image:Calculate Series and Parallel Resistance Step 1Bullet2.jpg|right|300px]]In this example,<br> R<sub>1</sub> = 100 Ω and R<sub>2</sub> = 300Ω are wired in series. R<sub>eq</sub> = 100 Ω + 300 Ω = 400 Ω",
